 "remarks": "Delightful dream home in the heart of downtown Stamford! This beautifully appointed modern 3-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom townhouse offers the perfect blend of convenience and urban living. Spacious 1,660 sq. ft. open floor plan with a contemporary kitchen, dining area and a large family room. Stunning primary bedroom suite complete with a luxurious en-suite bathroom and walk-in closet. Two additional bedrooms are generously sized, providing ample space for family, guests or a home office. Also includes all TVs and brackets. Situated just steps away from an array of shopping, dining and entertainment options, you'll never be far from everything downtown Stamford has to offer. Convenient access to Metro North and I-95. Don't wait to miss out on this great home!",
